,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-27T11:29:09Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T00:38:22Z","closed_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105819","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105819.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105819.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:33Z"},"body":"Add `IsImplicitlyDefined=\"true\"` to `PackageReference` tags in Sdk.targets.\r\n\r\nWill fix two problems i had with C# scripting.\r\n\r\n## 1. Prevent Package Manager in Visual Studio from trying to update SDK packages\r\n\r\nWhen viewing installed packages in IDE, Package Manager suggests updating `Godot.SourceGenerators`, `GodotSharp` and `GodotSharpEditor` to the latest version. Looks like this action doesn't do anything, but it can mislead user into thinking they upgraded their environment to the latest version.\r\n\r\nAdding `IsImplicitlyDefined` should prevent IDE from changing versions of these packages.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<summary>Screenshots</summary>\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n![vs-packagemanager-bugged](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fb2823a-b6d2-4739-ac1f-bcaf05f6f123)\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n![vs-packagemanager-fixed](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/221e1a31-6985-401c-b516-eb20bdce05a0)\r\n\r\n</details> \r\n\r\n## 2. Restore in Godot project fails when Central Package Management enabled\r\n\r\nWhen using CPM with Godot, restore fails with error:\r\n\r\n```\r\n/path/cpm-test/CPM Test.csproj : error NU1008: Projects that use central package version management should not define the version on the PackageReference items but on the PackageVersion items: Godot.SourceGenerators;GodotSharp;GodotSharpEditor.\r\n```\r\n\r\n[Example repository](https://github.com/hexog/godot-cpm-error)\r\n\r\nWith `IsImplicitlyDefined=\"true\"`, NuGet will not try to manage the SDK packages, resolving this error.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis change is backwards compatible and should not break anything in existing projects. However, since `IsImplicitlyDefined` is not properly documented, I’d appreciate it if someone more knowledgeable in MSBuild could ensure that nothing will break unexpectedly.\r\n\r\nWhat i found about `IsImplicitlyDefined`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/NuGet/Home/issues/13529\r\nhttps://github.com/dotnet/sdk/pull/43151/files#r1746148520\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105819/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105819/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}